This project ("text-extract") is a pipeline for Gujarati PDF text extraction, OCR verification,
and searchable artifact generation. The pipeline code in this repository is provided for
personal, research, educational, and non-commercial use.

The authors make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the fitness of this software
for any particular purpose. Use at your own risk.

---

